<symbol type="2" id="201" code="501.10" name="Paved area, light traffic, footprint: 10 m"><description>A paved area is an area with a firm surface such as asphalt, hard gravel, tiles, concrete or the like. It should be bordered (or framed) by the symbol Step or edge of paved area (501.1).
